WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Hello! It is Mini Quest Review.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Leo, Mia, Emma, and Toto see five badges.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Badge one: Hello. I’m Leo.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Badge two: It’s blue.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Badge three: How many? Five.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Badge four: Point. Draw. Open.

7
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Badge five: It’s a dog. It’s a cat.

8
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Mia says: I like cats.

9
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Emma says: I like birds.

10
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.000
The team makes a mini picture mission card. Goodbye!
